 "_doc": "The Fomor (Coim\u00edn's lay: the Fomorian giant Ois\u00edn fought for three days and nights; the Fomorians, the old sea raiders, later told of as misshapen): a huge hunched sea-giant with grey-green skin crusted with barnacles, seaweed for hair and beard, one great bulging eye and one small squinting one, tusks jutting up from his jaw, long arms, a hide wrapped round his waist hung with weed, and a great knotted club over his shoulder. Built by tools/art/build_otherworlds.py.",
